{"id":"otrazhenie","lemma":"отражение","pos":"noun","rank":3925,"glosses":["reflection, reverberation","repulse, parry, warding off"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/39/Ru-%D0%BE%D1%82%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%B6%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B5.ogg/Ru-%D0%BE%D1%82%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%B6%D0%B5%D0%BD%D0%B8%D0%B5.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"отражения","plural":"отражения"},"examples":[{"text":"Это отражение нашего общества.","en":"It's a reflection of our society.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},null,{"g":"our, ours","l":"наш"},{"g":"society, public","l":"общество"}]},{"text":"Я вижу своё отражение в окне.","en":"I see my reflection in the window.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to see","l":"видеть"},{"g":"one's own","l":"свой"},null,{"g":"in"},null]},{"text":"Отражения было видно в лужах.","en":"Reflections could be seen in the puddles.","words":[null,{"g":"was","l":"быть"},{"g":"it is visible"},{"g":"in"},null]},{"text":"Том увидел его отражение в зеркале.","en":"Tom saw his reflection in the mirror.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"to see","l":"увидеть"},{"g":"him / his"},null,{"g":"in"},null]},{"text":"Я смотрю на свое отражение в озере.","en":"I'm looking at my reflection in the lake.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to look, to gaze","l":"смотреть"},{"g":"on / at"},null,null,{"g":"in"},null]}]}